h new tool, and your notes and progress kept.

Gradify Plus is the part that organises your learning for you:

- Smart Plan autopilot. Your week planned for you, and kept on track when lif=
e gets in the way.
- Readiness forecasts and revision recommendations. Your cards ordered by wha=
t matters most and what you're starting to forget.
- Exam preparation. Timed exams over each part of a course and the whole cour=
se, and the complete question bank.
- Calendar sync and reminders. Plan around your Google, Apple or Outlook cale=
ndar, and get reminders even when Gradify is closed.
- No limits. Every lesson in every course, every flashcard set and every mind=
 map.
- Tools. Search every lesson on Gradify, build your own mind maps from the fa=
cts you pick, write flashcards with cloze and images, and turn any notes into=
 a mind map, flashcards, a chant or a cheatsheet.
- Every device. Your notes, flashcards, mind maps and progress up to date whe=
rever you study.


